message: "If you use CourseLens in your teaching or research, please cite the paper below."
title: "CourseLens"
abstract: >-
  A review workspace that organizes AI-proposed course updates by the course
  schedule, links proposed edits to rendered course materials, and shows which
  files an AI coding agent changed, checked, or never opened.
